# Ads Aggregation & In-App Ad Platform

This repository contains a starter platform for:
- aggregating ad data from Facebook, TikTok, and LinkedIn
- building an in-app ad server similar to Telegram-style ad placements
- serving ads to apps via a lightweight API
- tracking impression and click events

## Architecture

- Backend: FastAPI
- Database: PostgreSQL
- Cache: Redis
- Frontend starter: React
- Ad server: custom serving API for apps and placements

## Quick start

```bash
cp .env.example .env

docker compose up --build
```

Then open:
- Backend API: http://localhost:8000/docs
- Frontend: http://localhost:3000

## Example ad serve call

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ads/serve \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "app_id": 1,
    "placement_id": 1,
    "user_id_hash": "abc123",
    "geo": {"country": "US"},
    "device": {"platform": "android", "os_version": "14"}
  }'
```

## Example event tracking

```bash
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ads/events \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "campaign_id": 1,
    "placement_id": 1,
    "event_type": "click",
    "user_id_hash": "abc123",
    "revenue": 0.0
  }'
```

## In-app ad system

This starter supports:
- publisher apps
- ad placements (banner/interstitial/rewarded/native)
- campaigns assigned to placements
- CPM/CPC ad model logic
- ad event logging

